<title>GERMANY: Thyssen, Metallgesellschaft deny rumours.</title>
<headline>Thyssen, Metallgesellschaft deny rumours.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thyssen Industrie AG has no plans to take over German machinery maker Metallgesellschaft, spokesmen for the two companies said on Thursday, denying market rumours.</p>
<p>&quot;Nonsense,&quot; said the Thyssen spokesman. &quot;Humbug,&quot; said the Metallgesellschaft spokesman.</p>
<p>Thyssen shares traded 20 marks lower at 422.50, while Metallgesellschaft rose 2.05 marks to 40 marks.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
